#: inputs/chirpstack_MQTT_jmespath.py:53
msgid ""
"Subscribes to the ChirpStack v4 MQTT broker topic "
"(application/+/device/+/event/up) to receive events, and applies per-channel"
" JMESPath expressions to each event JSON to store measurements. Examples "
"(https://jmespath.org): object.battery_V, object.battery_pct, "
"max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi, max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr, deviceInfo.devEui."
msgstr ""
"ChirpStack v4 MQTT 브로커의 토픽(application/+/device/+/event/up)을 구독하여 이벤트를 수신하고,"
" 각 이벤트 JSON에 대해 채널별 JMESPath 표현식을 적용하여 측정값을 저장합니다. 예시(https://jmespath.org):"
" object.battery_V, object.battery_pct, max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi, "
"max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr, deviceInfo.devEui."

