#. lorawan_mode_manager — battery thresholds retuned for 4S LiFePO4
msgid ""
"Sets the mode-switching thresholds. Defaults assume a 4S LiFePO4 pack (12.8 "
"V nominal). For a 12 V lead-acid pack use 12.00 / 11.70 / 11.40 instead — "
"the two chemistries have completely different voltage curves."
msgstr ""
