"25%; lead-acid 12 V: 11.70 V)"
msgstr "절전 모드로 전환하는 전압 임계값 (4S 인산철: 13.00V ≈ 25%, 납산 12V: 11.70V)"

#. lorawan_mode_manager — battery thresholds retuned for 4S LiFePO4
msgid ""
"Voltage threshold for switching to ultra-saving mode (4S LiFePO4: 12.80 V ≈ "
